  "keyFeatures": [
    "Multi-tenant game server management with Wings node orchestration",
    "Organisation and team management with role-based access control",
    "Integrated billing system with plans, orders, and PDF invoices",
    "AI chat and studio endpoints with OpenAI-compatible API proxy",
    "Rust-based anti-abuse daemon detecting DDoS, port scanning, and crypto mining",
    "EcliTunnel: secure TCP tunnel system with client and server Rust agents",
    "DNS management via Cloudflare and PowerDNS integration",
    "Built-in mailbox system powered by Mailcow/Dovecot integration",
    "Identity verification with selfie/age checks and EU ID support",
    "Real-time WebSocket console, file manager, and server stats via SFTP and Wings proxy",
    "Feature flags system enabling/disabling registration, billing, AI, DNS, OAuth, and more",
    "SOC (Security Operations Center) dashboard for monitoring usage and abuse incidents"
  ],
